# SoundPlant demo: techno, 130 BPM, A minor. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# (tools/demos/web/ holds the songs written for the web; the others, tools/demos/*.xy, were made with private sample
# banks and get factory sounds in their place there.)
#   T1 kit: the 909 kick on every beat, a 909 clap on 2 and 4, the open hat on the offbeats, a 16th shaker
#   T2 acid "acid line": the 303, a rolling sixteenth line with accents and slides, its cutoff opened by hand
#   T3 knit "house stab": minor chord stabs into a dotted echo   T4 knit "dusty pad": the drone, pumped by the kick
#   T5 sample "riser": the sweep into the drop                    T6 jacquard "digi pluck": a sixteenth arpeggio
# Song: intro 4 (kick, hats), groove 8 (clap, shaker, the 303, the pad), breakdown 4 (no kick: the stabs and the pad;
# the last bar the snare rolling and the riser), peak 8 (everything, the arpeggio), outro 4.
bpm 130

# ---- the sounds (a hard 909 kick that rings a little, the pump of the whole mix by the kick, the 303 bright and
# resonant: the techno is in the kick, the line and the space around them)
# T1 the kit: the 909's kick (a little more drive than house's) and clap, its hats, a dry shaker
knob 1 d1.model 21
knob 1 d1.k1 52
knob 1 d1.k2 76
knob 1 d1.k3 34
knob 1 d1.k4 40
knob 1 d1.k5 0
knob 1 d1.k6 46
knob 1 d1.k7 0
knob 1 d5.model 25
knob 1 d5.k1 63
knob 1 d5.k2 50
knob 1 d5.k3 30
knob 1 d5.k4 0
knob 1 d5.volume 70
knob 1 d4.model 27
knob 1 d4.k1 64
knob 1 d4.k2 62
knob 1 d4.k3 0
knob 1 d4.k4 0
knob 1 d4.volume 68
knob 1 d3.model 26
knob 1 d3.k1 64
knob 1 d3.k2 70
knob 1 d3.k3 0
knob 1 d3.k4 0
knob 1 d3.volume 62
knob 1 d9.k1 50
knob 1 d9.k4 0
knob 1 d9.volume 58
knob 1 d8.volume 60
knob 1 res 30
knob 1 level 96
knob 1 send2 10
# T2 acid "acid line": the 303, ducked by the kick, resonant
preset 2 acid_line acid
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 cut 56
knob 2 res 104
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 ltype pump
knob 2 lspeed track_1
knob 2 lamt 40
knob 2 level 104
knob 2 send1 18
# T3 knit "house stab": the chord stabs, into the dotted echo
preset 3 house_stab knit
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 level 92
knob 3 send1 52
knob 3 send2 30
# T4 knit "dusty pad": the drone under it all, pumped by the kick, dark
preset 4 dusty_pad knit
knob 4 e1 5
knob 4 cut 70
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 ltype pump
knob 4 lspeed track_1
knob 4 lamt 100
knob 4 level 84
knob 4 send2 44
# T5 the riser: the sweep, into the hall
preset 5 riser sample
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 96
knob 5 send2 60
# T6 jacquard "digi pluck": the arpeggio, in the echo
preset 6 digi_pluck jacquard
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 pan 80
knob 6 level 84
knob 6 send1 46
knob 6 send2 24
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo; FX II a long hall, its high-pass keeping the low end dry
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 85
knob 11 e3 64
knob 11 e4 52
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 82
knob 12 e3 56
# the master: warm, the compressor firm, the whole mix breathing with the kick
mst lo 70
mst hi 62
mst comp 64
mst pump 26
mst pumpby kick
mst release 70
mst level 108

# ---- T1 the kit: kick 1, snare 2, hat 3, open 4, clap 5, shaker 9
# P1 the kick and the open hat; P2 the groove: the clap, a hat and the shaker; P3 the peak: the groove with a snare ghost leading into the next bar;
# P4 the build: the snare rolling; P5 the breakdown: the hat alone
pat 1 1 16 1 50 20
hits 1 1 1 x...x...x...x...
hits 1 1 4 ..x...x...x...x.
pat 1 2 16 1 50 20
hits 1 2 1 x...x...x...x...
hits 1 2 4 ..x...x...x...x.
hits 1 2 5 ....x.......x...
hits 1 2 3 g.g.g.g.g.g.g.g.
hits 1 2 9 gogxgogxgogxgogx
pat 1 3 16 1 50 20
hits 1 3 1 x...x...x...x...
hits 1 3 4 ..x...x...x...x.
hits 1 3 5 ....x.......x...
hits 1 3 3 g.g.g.g.g.g.g.g.
hits 1 3 9 gogxgogxgogxgogx
hits 1 3 2 ..........g...x.
pat 1 4 16 1 50 20
hits 1 4 2 x.x.x.x.xxxxxxxx
hits 1 4 9 gogxgogxgogxgogx
pat 1 5 16 1 50 20
hits 1 5 3 g.g.g.g.g.g.g.g.

# ---- T2 the 303 on Am. P1 a rolling sixteenth line: accents at 120, a note held past the next one's start slides
# into it (steps 7, 13); P2 the root alone, for the intro and the outro
pat 2 1 16 1 60 20
notes 2 1 1 0.5 120 A1
notes 2 1 2 0.5 100 A1
notes 2 1 4 0.5 100 A2
notes 2 1 5 0.5 100 A1
notes 2 1 6 0.5 110 A1
notes 2 1 7 1.25 120 C2
notes 2 1 8 0.5 100 E2
notes 2 1 9 0.5 110 A1
notes 2 1 10 0.5 100 A1
notes 2 1 12 0.5 100 A2
notes 2 1 13 1.25 120 G1
notes 2 1 14 0.5 100 A1
notes 2 1 16 0.5 110 E2
trick 2 1 16 porta 4
pat 2 2 16 1 60 20
notes 2 2 1 0.5 110 A1
notes 2 2 3 0.5 90 A1
notes 2 2 7 0.5 100 A1
notes 2 2 11 0.5 90 A1
notes 2 2 15 0.5 100 E2

# ---- T3 the stabs: Am | Am | G | F, on the offbeat sixteenths (two notes: the pad under them has the root and the fifth)
pat 3 1 64 1 50 20
notes 3 1 4 0.5 100 C4 E4
notes 3 1 7 0.5 90 C4 E4
notes 3 1 12 0.5 95 C4 E4
notes 3 1 15 0.5 85 C4 E4
notes 3 1 20 0.5 100 C4 E4
notes 3 1 23 0.5 90 C4 E4
notes 3 1 28 0.5 95 C4 E4
notes 3 1 31 0.5 85 C4 E4
notes 3 1 36 0.5 100 B3 D4
notes 3 1 39 0.5 90 B3 D4
notes 3 1 44 0.5 95 B3 D4
notes 3 1 47 0.5 85 B3 D4
notes 3 1 52 0.5 100 A3 C4
notes 3 1 55 0.5 90 A3 C4
notes 3 1 60 0.5 95 A3 C4
notes 3 1 63 0.5 85 A3 C4
chance 3 1 15 70
chance 3 1 47 70

# ---- T4 the pad: root and fifth, Am held two bars, then G, then F
pat 4 1 64 1 100
notes 4 1 1 32 70 A2 E3
notes 4 1 33 16 70 G2 D3
notes 4 1 49 16 70 F2 C3

# ---- T5 the riser: one sweep through the bar before the drop (scene 6)
pat 5 1 16 1 100
notes 5 1 6 10 110 C4

# ---- T6 the arpeggio: A minor in sixteenths, up and back, the chord following the stabs
pat 6 1 64 1 60 20
notes 6 1 1 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 2 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 3 1 90 E5
notes 6 1 4 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 5 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 6 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 7 1 90 E5
notes 6 1 8 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 9 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 10 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 11 1 90 E5
notes 6 1 12 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 13 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 14 1 80 E5
notes 6 1 15 1 90 C5
notes 6 1 16 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 17 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 18 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 19 1 90 E5
notes 6 1 20 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 21 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 22 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 23 1 90 E5
notes 6 1 24 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 25 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 26 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 27 1 90 E5
notes 6 1 28 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 29 1 100 A4
notes 6 1 30 1 80 E5
notes 6 1 31 1 90 C5
notes 6 1 32 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 33 1 100 G4
notes 6 1 34 1 80 B4
notes 6 1 35 1 90 D5
notes 6 1 36 1 80 B4
notes 6 1 37 1 100 G4
notes 6 1 38 1 80 B4
notes 6 1 39 1 90 D5
notes 6 1 40 1 80 B4
notes 6 1 41 1 100 G4
notes 6 1 42 1 80 B4
notes 6 1 43 1 90 D5
notes 6 1 44 1 80 B4
notes 6 1 45 1 100 G4
notes 6 1 46 1 80 D5
notes 6 1 47 1 90 B4
notes 6 1 48 1 80 G4
notes 6 1 49 1 100 F4
notes 6 1 50 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 51 1 90 C5
notes 6 1 52 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 53 1 100 F4
notes 6 1 54 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 55 1 90 C5
notes 6 1 56 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 57 1 100 F4
notes 6 1 58 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 59 1 90 C5
notes 6 1 60 1 80 A4
notes 6 1 61 1 100 F4
notes 6 1 62 1 80 C5
notes 6 1 63 1 90 A4
notes 6 1 64 1 80 F4

# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, x = muted. Scene 3 the breakdown's first three bars, 6 its last (the
# snare rolling, the riser)
scenedef 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 .xx.xxxx
scenedef 2 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 ..x.xxxx
scenedef 3 5 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 .x..xxxx
scenedef 4 3 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 4 ....x.xx
scenedef 5 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 5 ..x.xxxx
scenedef 6 4 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 6 .x...xxx
song 1:4 2:8 3:3 6:1 4:8 5:4
songloop 0

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY), and perform

knob 2 cut 54
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav soundplant_demo_techno.wav
tap PLAY
# intro 4
bars 4
# groove 8: the 303's filter opened by hand
knob 2 cut 60
bars 2
knob 2 cut 68
bars 2
knob 2 cut 76
bars 3.75
throw echo on perc
bars 0.25
throw echo off perc
# breakdown 4
bars 4
# peak 8
knob 2 cut 84
bars 4
knob 2 cut 92
bars 4
# outro 4: the line closing
knob 2 cut 70
bars 2
knob 2 cut 56
bars 2
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
